 "strings": {
  "Long story short, Higashi used\nthe database and found his man.": "",
  "Well, Higashi used the database\nand found his man.": "",
  "A homeless guy living on the streets of Kamurocho.\nKnown around town as Red Nose.": "",
  "Here, just sent you a pic. That's what he looked\nlike before his life went to shit.": "",
  "Here, just sent you a photo. That's him\nbefore he was homeless, at least.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(...This is Red Nose?)</color> ": "",
  "I don't think his nose is all that red.": "",
  "Huh. Is his nose really that red?": "",
  "Not my name, don't ask me.": "",
  "Not my nickname, don't ask me.": "",
  "Anyway, I think you know what came next.": "",
  "Well, anyway...\nI think you know what came next.": "",
  "He tracked Red Nose down and took the money back.\nBut Kaito-san's still out in the cold.": "",
  "Ain't that funny? Meanwhile Higashi's shooting up\nthe ranks. Guess he got on Hamura's good side.": "",
  "Higashi's climbed the ranks in the meantime, though.\nAll that work got him on the captain's good side.": "",
  "And Red Nose?": "",
  "And Red Nose? Where'd he go?": "",
  "Haven't heard a peep about him.\nAnd I'm keen to keep it that way.": "",
  "Higashi never talked much about him.\nI wasn't too keen on asking, either.": "",
  "Higashi didn't... kill him, did he?": "",
  "You don't think Higashi... killed him, do you?": "",
  "Beats me.": "",
  "Well? How was it?\nWorth the hundred Gs?": "",
  "So how was it?\nWorth the hundred Gs?": "",
  "A year ago, Higashi must have turned the city\nupside down looking for Red Nose...": "",
  "Back then... Higashi must have scoured the city to\ntrack down Red Nose. Probably asked the homeless.": "",
  "If a guy like him could\npull that off, so can I.": "",
  "...If he can do it, so can I.\nRed Nose, huh...?": "",
  "(I need to figure out if Red Nose is still alive.\nMaybe the homeless people around town would know more...) ": "",
  "Sorry, can I ask you something?": "",
  "Depends.\nWhaddya want?": "",
  "Mm? Whaddaya want?": "",
  "I'm looking for someone.\nMan by the name of Red Nose.": "",
  "Red Nose?\nNever heard of him.": "",
  "Nothing, huh?": "",
  "But, maybe my friends'd\nknow something.": "",
  "Can you ask them?": "",
  "You bet.\nMight take some time, though.": "",
  "That's all right.\nI can wait.": "",
  "If you say so.\nOh, and in return...": "",
  "I've got this thing called a Play Pass.\nYou mind taking a shot at it?": "",
  "Say, buddy, you mind using\nthis Play Pass for a bit?": "",
  "...Come again?": "",
  "It's for a new game this bigshot committee just opened.\nThey call it Dice & Cube over at Paradise VR.": "",
  "It's for a new game this bigshot Kamurocho committee\njust started. They call it VR Dice & Cube.": "",
  "It's uh, some kinda fancy board game. You wear\nstupid glasses, you roll dice... Heck if I know.": "",
  "It's, uh... some kinda interactive experience thing?\nY'know Suguroku, the board game? Like that, but life-size.": "",
  "It's over on Theater Alley, and you need\none of the Play Passes to get in.": "",
  "They'll let ya give it a shot over on Theater Alley\nif you've got one o' them Play Passes.": "",
  "Huh, this town's crazy sometimes.": "",
  "Huh. Never knew that\nkinda thing existed.": "",
  "I hear they got some pretty\nnice prizes if you win, too.": "",
  "I hear you can rake in the prizes\nif you manage to win, too.": "",
  "But my legs are shot to shit.\nNo VR for this hobo.": "",
  "My legs're kinda shot, though, as you can see.\nNo playtime for this hobo.": "",
  "Yeah, I guess you'd still\nhave to move around.": "",
  "Right, it would be tough\nfor you to move around.": "",
  "I got a few friends who've tried,\nbut it sounds like they're all havin' trouble.": "",
  "Sooo, I want you to get a prize for me.\nYoung guy like you can do it no problem. Whaddya say?": "",
  "You're a strapping young fella, so it'll be easy for you.\nGo win a little prize for me, huh? Whaddya say?": "",
  "Sounds interesting... All right.\nYou wait here. I'll go win you that prize.": "",
  "Sounds interesting... All right.\nYou wait here, and I'll go win you that prize.": "",
  "Thanks a million, buddy. I'll ask around\nabout your Red Nose in the meantime.": "",
  "Great! In that case, I'll ask around\nand see if anyone knows your guy.": "",
  "Hello, do you have a second?": "",
  "Hey, do you have a second?": "",
  "I'm looking for a man\nnamed Red Nose.": "",
  "Red Nose? \nThat homeless guy?": "",
  "And you're asking me?\nHe homeless, too?": "",
  "Yeah, I know him.\nAin't seen him in at least a year, though.": "",
  "...Yeah, I know him.\nHaven't seen him for about a year, though.": "",
  "Any idea where he went?": "",
  "Don't think so.": "",
  "...Maybe a drink will\njog your memory?": "",
  "Maybe a drink will\njog your memory?": "",
  "Nah, I really don't know. \nGo bug someone else.": "",
  "Nah, I seriously don't know.\nGo bug someone else.": "",
  "Sorry, mind if I ask you a question?": "",
  "Do you know a homeless guy named Red Nose?\nHear he lives around here.": "",
  "Do you know a guy by the name of Red Nose?\nHear he's a homeless guy based around here.": "",
  "Nope, not ringing a bell.\nI only just moved to this part o' town.": "",
  "Oh, okay.\nSorry to bother you.": "",
  "Do you have a minute, sir?": "",
  "Whaddya want?": "",
  "You call that a red nose?\nI sure as hell don't.": "",
  "Red Nose?\nShit doesn't look red to me.": "",
  "I thought the same thing. Guess that's\nwhat his friends call him, though.": "",
  "I know, right? Guess that's what his\nfriends call him, though.": "",
  "Never seen him. Now fuck off, yeah?": "",
  "Never seen the guy.\nNow fuck off, yeah?": "",
  "Damn, guy.": "",
  "Excuse me, can I ask you something?": "",
  "Not interested, sorry.": "",
  "It won't be long, please.\nDo you know a man named Red Nose?": "",
  "Please, I swear I won't be long.\nDo you know a man that people call Red Nose?": "",
  "Oh... Suppose he looks familiar.": "",
  "Hm... Looks familiar, yeah.": "",
  "Any idea where he is?": "",
  "So, any idea where he is?": "",
  "Haven't seen him in ages, man.\nI'd guess he skipped town, or worse.": "",
  "Not a one. Haven't seen him in ages.\nBet he skipped town or some shit.": "",
  "Oh. Thanks.": "",
  "(Great. Now to give this to the homeless guy\nand figure out where Red Nose is.)": "",
  "(Too bad. Guess I should report back\nto the homeless guy.) ": "",
  "Hey pal, how'd it go?\nGet me one of those sweet VR prizes?": "",
  "Hey, pal! How'd it go?\nYou win me that sweet VR prize?": "",
  "Piece of cake.": "",
  "Sure did.": "",
  "Whoa, for real? I wasn't expectin'\nyou to actually win!": "",
  "Whoa, for real?\nI wasn't expectin' you to actually win!": "",
  "You couldn't do it, huh?\nOh well, sorry for borrowing your legs.": "",
  "What, you couldn't do it?\nMeh, fine. Sorry for borrowing your legs.": "",
  "Anyways, I asked around\nabout your Red Nose fella.": "",
  "Anyways, I asked around for you,\ntrying to find out about your Red Nose fella.": "",
  "Still dunno where he is,\nbut I did find who might.": "",
  "Didn't really have much luck.\nBut I did find someone who might have more clues.": "",
  "Least that's what they told me.\nOh, and speak of the devil.": "",
  "You're the one looking\nfor that homeless guy, yeah?": "",
  "Hey. You're the one looking for\nthat homeless guy, yeah?": "",
  "You find him?": "",
  "No, not yet.": "",
  "Try headin' over to the Children's Park, then.\nSome volunteers're handing out free food.": "",
  "Okay... Try headin' over to the Children's Park, then.\nSome volunteers're handing out free food.": "",
  "All the hungry homeless\nof Kamurocho'll be there.": "",
  "Thanks for the tip.": "",
  "Really... Thanks for the tip.": "",
  "Eh, don't mention it. Seeya.": "",
  "Eh, don't mention it.\nSeeya.": "",
  "Sorry, turns out I suck.": "",
  "No... sorry.": "",
  "Yo, it's Kaito.\nWhere are you?": "",
  "It's Kaito.\nWhere are you, Tak?": "",
  "On my way to the Children's Park.\nThink I might run into the thief.": "",
  "You mean the guy who robbed\nus is still in town?": "",
  "Wait, you mean the thief is still in Kamurocho?\nEven after pissing off the yakuza?": "",
  "Not sure. But even if he isn't,\nI might find a lead or two.": "",
  "Even if he isn't,\nI might find a lead or two.": "",
  "According to Ayabe, the thief\nwas a homeless guy by the name of Red Nose.": "",
  "According to Ayabe, the Matsugane's thief was a\nhomeless guy by the name of Red Nose.": "",
  "You're saying a bum took our money?": "",
  "Red Nose? You're saying some homeless guy\ntook our money?": "",
  "Looks like it.": "",
  "No clue if he's still alive, though.\nAfter Higashi got to him, that is.": "",
  "Thing is, Higashi got to him before we did.\nNo clue if the guy's still alive.": "",
  "Right. Well, I'm in.\nSee you at the Children's Park, yeah?": "",
  "Got it. Well, I'm in.\nSee you at the Children's Park, yeah?": "",
  "You heading to the Children's Park, too?": "",
  "Me? Nah, I already ate.": "",
  "Mm? Nah, I'm good.\nAlready ate.": "",
  "By the way, this guy I'm looking for.\nName's Red Nose. You know him?": "",
  "By the way, the guy I'm looking for is called Red Nose.\nYou know him?": "",
  "Naw, man. If you wanna find him,\nyou should go check that food handout.": "",
  "Naw, man. If you wanna find him,\nyou probably wanna get goin' to that food handout.": "",
  "It's gonna end soon, y'know.\nChildren's Park. Don't forget.": "",
  "It's gonna end soon, y'know.\nDon't forget, Children's Park.": "",
  "Hey, sorry about this.": "",
  "Well, sorry 'bout this.": "",
  "Looks like they weren't handing\nout food after all. My bad.": "",
  "Looks like they weren't handing out food\nafter all. My bad.": "",
  "So we're doing this instead?": "",
  "You want something?": "",
  "Red Nose sends his regards!": "",
  "You guys are getting old for this.\nWhy'd you attack me?": "",
  "I didn't realize you were all so old.\nWhy'd you attack me?": "",
  "We wanted...\nto know who you are...": "",
  "We just wanted...\nto know who you are...": "",
  "Why would someone wanna know\nabout Red Nose now?": "",
  "Why would someone wanna\nknow about Red Nose now?": "",
  "So you're a friend of his?\nIs he still alive?": "",
  "So, you're connected to Red Nose?\nIs he still alive?": "",
  "...No.\nHasn't been for a while now.": "",
  "When'd he die?": "",
  "'Bout a year ago.\nSomeone found him floating face-up in the sewer.": "",
  "Body was all shot up with bullet holes.": "",
  "Body was all shot up with holes.": "",
  "Shot?\nDid you go the police?": "",
  "Shot?\nDid you go to the police?": "",
  "No. Of course not.": "",
  "What're the cops gonna do for us?\nDead bum in a ditch is just more paperwork for them.": "",
  "Either way, his body's long gone.": "",
  "Either way, his body's long gone now.": "",
  "But we still wanna find out what happened to him.\nThat's the best funeral we can give him now.": "",
  "All the same, we just wanna find out what happened.\nIt's the least we can do for him.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(So their friend got murdered\nand they couldn't do a damn thing about it...)</color> ": "",
  "Don't have a clue who killed him,\nthough. Or why.": "",
  "Don't have a clue who killed him,\nor why...": "",
  "All we remember is that a year ago,\nsome Tojo Clan yakuza was looking for him.": "",
  "But... what we do know is that a year ago,\nsome Tojo Clan yakuza was looking for him.": "",
  "Must be Higashi...\nAnd is that yakuza the one who killed Red Nose?": "",
  "Higashi...?\nSo this yakuza... He's the killer?": "",
  "Not sure. Those types're kinda\nout of our league, y'know?": "",
  "Not sure. Those types are kind of\nout of our league, y'know?": "",
  "We thought if anyone would know something,\nit'd be you. That's why we...": "",
  "So, we thought if anyone would know something,\nit'd be you...": "",
  "Sorry, but my buddy here's got more fight\nin him than some random yakuza.": "",
  "Too bad for you. My buddy here's got more fight in him\nthan some random yakuza.": "",
  "Fighting's been the only constant\nthing in his life.": "",
  "Fighting's been the only constant\nin his life.": "",
  "Heh, that's Kamurocho for you.": "",
  "...That's Kamurocho for you.": "",
  "You're late, Kaito-san.": "",
  "Is this the guy who was\nlooking for Red Nose?": "",
  "I think we know the guy who\nhad it out for Red Nose. This him?": "",
  "Yup, that's him.\nNot a doubt in my mind.": "",
  "Ah... That's him.\nNo doubt in my mind.": "",
  "So. A year ago, Higashi took the money back\nfrom Red Nose and returned it to the Matsugane Family.": "",
  "So a year ago, Higashi took the money back\nfrom Red Nose and returned it to the Matsugane Family.": "",
  "Around the same time,\nRed Nose turns up ice-cold in the sewer.": "",
  "And Red Nose turns up\ncold in the sewer.": "",
  "Who do you think killed him?": "",
  "I... I just can't believe it.\nHigashi's not a murderer.": "",
  "I dunno. I... just can't believe it.\nHigashi's not a murderer.": "",
  "Where would he have even gotten a gun?": "",
  "Where would he even have\ngotten a gun?": "",
  "There're ways.\nThis is Kamurocho, remember?": "",
  "There're plenty of ways.\nThis is Kamurocho, remember?": "",
  "I'm gonna go talk to Higashi.": "",
  "You're coming too, right Kaito-san?": "",
  "You coming with, Kaito-san?": "",
  "Don't you wanna know what happened?": "",
  "You do wanna know\nwhat really happened, right?": "",
  "Okay. I'll come.": "",
  "Fine. I'll come.": "",
  "Let's head to Charles then.": "",
  "Higashi should be at Charles.": "",
  "I didn't...\nI didn't kill him.": "",
  "Look... I didn't kill him.": "",
  "I'm not the one who murdered Red Nose.": "",
  "I didn't kill Red Nose.\nIt wasn't me.": "",
  "Then who the hell was it?": "",
  "Red Nose must have had a contact in the Matsugane Family.\nThat's the only way he got away with it.": "",
  "And whoever that contact was\ngave him all sorts of info.": "",
  "And whoever that contact was\ngave him all kinds of info.": "",
  "When security was light. Where the safe was.\nNot to mention when there'd be the most money.": "",
  "There's no way you steal from\nthe yakuza without some help.": "",
  "I figure... there's no way to steal from\nthe yakuza without some help.": "",
  "So, is Red Nose's contact the one\nwho killed him? To cover it all up?": "",
  "So Red Nose's killer... It's got to be his contact, right?\nThey killed him to hide the truth.": "",
  "But who would've done something like that?\nStealin' their own family's money...": "",
  "It wasn't about the money.": "",
  "That's not it.\nIt was never about the money.": "",
  "They wanted to rub you\nout of the picture, Kaito.": "",
  "They just wanted you out of the picture, Kaito...\nThey set all this up so you'd take the fall.": "",
  "That's why it happened\nwhen you were on guard duty.": "",
  "That's why it went down\nwhen you were on guard duty.": "",
  "To rub me out? If that's it,\nthen the contact must've been...": "",
  "Wait, me...?\nSo then, the contact must've been...": "",
  "Yeah. Captain Hamura.": "",
  "You were the only thing between him\nand total control of the family.": "",
  "In his eyes, you were the only one\nstanding in his way.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Beats me.": "ไม่รู้เหมือนกัน",
  "...Come again?": "...ว่าไงนะคะ?",
  "Sure did.": "ใช่เลย",
  "No, not yet.": "ไม่ ยังไม่ใช่ตอนนี้",
  "Looks like it.": "ท่าทางจะงั้นแหละ"
 }
}
